# Optional Pipeline process environment
#
# Pipeline does not load this file itself. If an external runner sources a copy,
# keep role and runtime identity out of it: Codex/AGY launchers derive their
# identity variables, while Cursor sessionStart binds CURSOR_* and seat identity.
# Each linked worktree uses its native Git index; never set GIT_INDEX_FILE here.
# Do not store private key material or API credentials in this file.

# GitHub Actions sets CI automatically. Local runners may uncomment it only when
# they intentionally need CI-mode output.
# CI=1

# Optional absolute path to the off-repository Ed25519 private-key directory.
# The directory must be mode 0700 and every *.ed25519 file mode 0600.
# THREEWAY_KEYSTORE=/absolute/path/to/threeway/keys
